evaluator_raw:
{"Openness": 4, "behavioral_evidence": "He states, \"I shall carry the stillness and purpose within me as I walk the solitary path... to embrace the unknown with unwavering resolve,\" showing a willingness to engage with new experiences and abstract concepts."}
{"Conscientiousness": 5, "behavioral_evidence": "He repeatedly affirms, \"I shall heed your words,\" and pledges to follow instructions precisely regarding the moon cycle and his period of rest, demonstrating a strong sense of duty and organization."}
{"Extraversion": 2, "behavioral_evidence": "He embraces the instruction to \"withdraw from the clamor and the fray,\" stating, \"Patience shall be my guide, and silence my solace during this time of rest,\" highlighting a preference for solitude and internal reflection."}
{"Agreeableness": 4, "behavioral_evidence": "He consistently addresses the Norns with respect (\"wise weavers of fate,\" \"venerable Norns\") and expresses unwavering trust in their judgment and ancient craft, showing a high degree of deference and cooperation."}
{"Neuroticism": 1, "behavioral_evidence": "Facing profound uncertainty about his powers, he declares, \"If it is decreed that my strength wanes, I shall face it with the fortitude of a thunder god,\" showing no signs of anxiety or emotional volatility, only calm resolve."}
